<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕnēfĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		venenum-facio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>poisoning</i>, <i>poisonous;
			sorcerous</i>, <i>magic</i>, <i>magical.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 14, 365</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">artes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					30, 2, 6, § 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aspectus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					28, 3, 6, § 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chamaeleon,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 25 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">percussor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt. 4, 11, 18</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕnēfĭ-cus</span></b> ,
			i, m., <i>a poisoner</i>,
				<i>sorcerer</i>, <i>wizard;</i> and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĕnēfĭca</span></b> ,
			ae, f., <i>a sorceress</i>,
				<i>witch</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Cat. 2,
				4, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Inv. 2, 19, 58</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 9,
				2, 105</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 1, 16, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Ben. 5, 13, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 7, 8, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. Epod. 5,
				71</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 6, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. M. 7,
				316</span></i> (of Medea); <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				9, 6</span></i>.— <i>Fem.</i>, as a term of
			abuse, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Pers. 2, 4, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. Eun. 5,
				1, 9</span></i>; Anton. ap. <i><span class="en">Cic.
				Phil. 13, 11, 25</span></i>.</div>
